---
// Privacy policy: what the site, its forms and its click tracking record. Mirrors the clicks, claims
// and corrections tables in supabase/migrations; change this page when those change.
import { site } from "../../lib/site.ts";
import Operator from "./Operator.astro";
import Email from "./Email.astro";
---
<p>This page explains what {site.name} records about visitors and what we do with it. The site is run by <Operator />.</p>

<h2>Browsing</h2>
<p>
  Pages on this site don't use cookies, analytics, ads or tracking pixels. Our web host keeps standard
  server logs, such as IP address, browser type and the page requested, to run and protect the service.
</p>

<h2>Clicks</h2>
<p>
  When you use a Website, Call or Directions button, or an affiliate link, we record the kind of click,
  the page it came from, the shop or program it went to, and the time. These records don't include your
  IP address or anything else that identifies you.
</p>

<h2>Forms</h2>
<p>
  If you report a change to a listing, we store what you wrote, the shop and the time. If you add or
  claim a shop, we store the details you send and your email address. We use them only to review your
  submission, update the listing and reply to you.
</p>

<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
<p>
  After you follow an affiliate link you're on the seller's site, where its own privacy policy applies.
  The seller or its affiliate network may set a cookie to credit us for a sale.
</p>

<h2>Who handles the data</h2>
<p>Our database is hosted by Supabase. We don't sell what we record or share it with anyone else.</p>

<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>
  To ask what we hold about you, or to have it deleted, email <Email />. A shop owner can ask for their
  shop to be removed; it then disappears from this site.
</p>
